<title>USA: King World Q1 net drops vs yr ago gain.</title>
<headline>King World Q1 net drops vs yr ago gain.</headline>
<dateline>NEW YORK 1997-01-14</dateline>
<text>
<p>1996			1995</p>
<p> Shr			   0.93		    $1.17</p>
<p> Net			 34,967		   43,662</p>
<p> Revs		     164,287		  162,139</p>
<p> Avg shrs		  37,700		   37,400</p>
<p>(All Data Above 000s Except Per Share Numbers)</p>
<p>NOTE: The above results are for the quarter ended Nov. 30.</p>
<p>Full company name is King World Productions Inc.</p>
<p>The 1995 results included a $14.1 million gain from the sale of Buffalo Broadcasting Co Inc.</p>
